% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a gamma gray space collapses to CalGray. A CIEBasedA space
% whose DecodeA is a single exponent, whose MatrixA is the white point,
% and whose LMN stage is the identity is carried as a CalGray space
% with that gamma; the fill's component passes through unchanged.
[/CIEBasedA <<
  /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
  /DecodeA {2.2 exp} bind
  /MatrixA [0.9505 1 1.089]
  /RangeLMN [0 0.9505 0 1 0 1.089]
>>] setcolorspace
0.5 setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
